            "custom_liquid": "<div style=\"background: none;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;\">\n    Here’s What Your Shieldeck Timeline Will Look Like*\n  </h3>\n\n  <div style=\"height: 1px; background: #00B5DF; margin-bottom: 2rem;\"></div>\n\n  <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 25px;\">\n\n    <!-- Day 1 -->\n    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0515/2459/9996/files/Layer_1-1.png?v=1752998685\" alt=\"Plug Icon\" style=\"width: 26px; height: 26px; margin-top: 4px;\">\n      <div>\n        <div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #00B5DF;\">DAY 1 <span style=\"color: #00B5DF;\">The First Trap</span></div>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 400;\">\n          You plug in your BuzzTrap™ for the first time. The UV light activates and starts attracting pests—silently and instantly.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Day 3 -->\n    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4672/7723/files/Subtract_bf2fd39a-d312-4238-a2a7-ab36cd1a82af.png?v=1747731915\" alt=\"Sun Icon\" style=\"width: 26px; height: 26px; margin-top: 4px;\">\n      <div>\n        <div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #00B5DF;\">DAY 3 <span style=\"color: #00B5DF;\">Buzz-Free Mornings</span></div>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 400;\">\n          Fewer gnats and flies near windows and fruit bowls. Nights are quieter. Mornings feel clean, calm, and bite-free.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Day 7 -->\n    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4672/7723/files/Vector_bb6fd92b-ca8f-4d55-8de4-5ad5c4cfea75.png?v=1747731914\" alt=\"Lightning Icon\" style=\"width: 26px; height: 26px; margin-top: 4px;\">\n      <div>\n        <div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #00B5DF;\">DAY 7 <span style=\"color: #00B5DF;\">Protection You Can See</span></div>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 400;\">\n          Your sticky pad is filling up. The trap is working. Your space feels more protected—no sprays, fumes, or swatting needed.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Day 30 -->\n    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4672/7723/files/Group_21131.png?v=1747731914\" alt=\"Rocket Icon\" style=\"width: 26px; height: 26px; margin-top: 4px;\">\n      <div>\n        <div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #00B5DF;\">DAY 30 <span style=\"color: #00B5DF;\">Pest-Free Living</span></div>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 400;\">\n          You’ve replaced your pad once or twice. Bugs are practically gone. Your home smells clean and feels safe—every single day.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Day 60+ -->\n    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4672/7723/files/Group_21132.png?v=1747731914\" alt=\"Meter Icon\" style=\"width: 26px; height: 26px; margin-top: 4px;\">\n      <div>\n        <div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #00B5DF;\">DAY 60+ <span style=\"color: #00B5DF;\">Peace of Mind, Always</span></div>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 400;\">\n          Shieldeck is now a part of your home. No chemicals. No effort. Just invisible protection that keeps your space clean, safe, and bug-free—year-round.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
